"progress.info.title" = "How to Use Learning Progress";
"progress.info.message" = "Learning Progress tracks your performance across all subjects based on graded homework and completed practice sessions.\n\nWhat You See:\n  • Subject cards showing accuracy percentage and total questions answered\n  • Trend arrows indicating whether performance is improving, stable, or declining\n  • Daily streak — consecutive days with recorded study activity\n\nHow to Filter:\n  • Tap the menu button (top right) to switch between This Week, This Month, and All Time\n  • Tap any subject card to open a detailed breakdown with charts and AI insights\n\nHow Accuracy Is Calculated:\n  • Correct answers divided by total graded attempts, as a percentage\n  • Both homework and practice session results are included\n\nTips:\n  • Pull down to refresh and load your latest results\n  • Focus on subjects with lower accuracy for the most efficient improvement";"tomatoGarden.info.title" = "About Tomato Garden";
"tomatoGarden.info.message" = "Tomato Garden is a reward and collection system tied to your Pomodoro focus sessions.\n\nHow You Earn Tomatoes:\n  • Complete a 25-minute Pomodoro session to earn one tomato\n  • Each session awards a randomly selected tomato from 13 collectible types\n\nRarity Tiers:\n  • Tier 1 — Common: Classic, Curly, Cute\n  • Tier 2 — Uncommon varieties\n  • Tier 3 — Rare character varieties\n  • Tier 4 — Legendary: Golden, Platinum, Diamond\n\nUpgrading Your Collection:\n  • Collect 5 tomatoes of the same tier to exchange them for 1 tomato of the next higher tier\n  • Use the Exchange button to trade up your collection\n\nYour Garden:\n  • Displays up to 25 tomatoes at a time\n  • Tap the Physics button to enable Physics Garden mode with realistic movement\n\nFilters and Stats:\n  • Filter by tomato type or date earned\n  • Stats show total tomatoes collected, total focus time, and your longest session";"passiveReports.info.title" = "About Study Reports";
"passiveReports.info.message" = "Study Reports are AI-generated analyses of your learning activity, produced automatically on a weekly and monthly basis.\n\nWhat Each Report Batch Includes:\n  • Executive Summary — overall performance overview for the period\n  • Academic Performance — accuracy and question counts by subject\n  • Learning Behavior — study session patterns and habits\n  • Motivation and Engagement — focus duration and effort indicators\n  • Progress Trajectory — improvement or decline trends over time\n  • Risk and Opportunity — subjects and topics that need the most attention\n  • Action Plan — specific, personalized recommendations for the next period\n\nHow to Use This Screen:\n  • Switch between the Weekly and Monthly tabs at the top\n  • Tap the + button to manually generate a new report batch\n  • Tap any report card to read the full analysis\n  • Tap Edit to delete old report batches\n\nData Sources:\n  • Reports draw from your completed homework sessions, archived AI chats, and practice results";"library.select" = "Select";

"library.info.title" = "Your Library";
"library.info.message" = "Your Library stores all saved questions and archived conversations in a single, searchable location.\n\nWhat Is Stored:\n  • Questions — individual questions archived after a homework session\n  • Conversations — full AI chat sessions saved from the Chat screen\n\nNavigating Your Library:\n  • Use the tabs at the top to filter by All, Questions, or Conversations\n  • Use the search bar to find items by subject, title, or keyword\n  • Tap any item to open and review its full content\n\nActions:\n  • Swipe left on any item to delete it\n  • Tap the menu button (top right) to enter Select mode\n  • In Select mode, choose multiple items to export as PDF or delete in bulk\n\nTips:\n  • Archive important questions immediately after reviewing homework results\n  • Use the Conversations tab to revisit AI explanations from past sessions";"homeworkResults.info.title" = "Understanding Your Results";
"homeworkResults.info.message" = "Homework Results displays each question from your submission with a full AI-generated analysis and grade.\n\nReading Your Results:\n  • Each card shows the original question, the correct answer, and a step-by-step explanation\n  • Tap any card to expand it and read the full analysis\n\nColor Coding:\n  • Green — correct answer\n  • Orange — partially correct or incomplete\n  • Red — incorrect answer\n\nGrading Modes:\n  • Standard mode provides fast analysis for most homework\n  • Deep mode applies extended reasoning for complex or multi-step questions\n\nArchiving Questions:\n  • Tap the checkbox on a question card to select it\n  • Tap the Archive button (top right) to save selected questions to your Library\n  • Archived questions can be reviewed and re-attempted from the Library or Mistake Review screens\n\nProgress Tracking:\n  • Results automatically update your subject accuracy in the Learning Progress screen\n  • Incorrect answers are recorded for analysis in the Mistake Review screen";"progress.yourLearningJourney" = "Your Learning Journey";
